    <entry>
      <title>题解：P11725 修学旅行</title>
      <link href="/2026/11/11/%E9%A2%98%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9AP11725%20%5BJOIG%202025%5D%20%E4%BF%AE%E5%AD%A6%E6%97%85%E8%A1%8C/"/>
      <url>/2026/11/11/%E9%A2%98%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9AP11725%20%5BJOIG%202025%5D%20%E4%BF%AE%E5%AD%A6%E6%97%85%E8%A1%8C/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="part0-前情提要"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#part0-前情提要"></a> Part.0 前情提要</h2><ul><li>这篇题解与本题的其他题解有许多不同，其他题解无一例外全部是三叉线段树，而这篇题解，是适合初学线段树的同学学习的，基础二叉线段树题解。</li><li>只需了解线段树这种数据结构，或者能独立用线段树写出单点修改，查询区间加就能完全看懂这篇文章。</li></ul><h2 id="part1-简要题意"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#part1-简要题意"></a> Part.1 简要题意</h2><p>给定一个长度为 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3^N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8413309999999999em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">3</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8413309999999999em;"><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的只包含 A 和 B 的字符串。每次将相邻三个字符合并为一个字符，三个字符中出现次数较多的字符作为合并结果，重复 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span></span></span></span> 次操作后得到只剩下一个字符。</p><p>接下来有 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8777699999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">Q</span></span></span></span> 次操作，每次翻转指定位置的字符（A 变 B，B 变 A），要求输出每次操作后最终剩下的那个字符。</p><h2 id="part2-思路解析"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#part2-思路解析"></a> Part.2 思路解析</h2><h3 id="21-思路简述"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#21-思路简述"></a> 2.1 思路简述</h3><p>对于一个已经学习线段树很久的人来说，遇到此题，会直接写出三叉线段树来维护这个序列，这当然是代码长度与时间复杂度都最优的选择，但是本人比较菜，只会普通的二叉线段树，所以考虑用二叉线段树维护这个东西。</p><p>我们注意到每次操作初始长度为 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3^N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8413309999999999em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">3</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8413309999999999em;"><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的字符串，只需要经过 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span></span></span></span> 此次操作就可以得到最后剩余的字符串，所以考虑用 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span></span></span></span> 棵线段树维护每次操作前的字符串，编号从 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span> 到 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">n</span></span></span></span>，第 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.65952em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">i</span></span></span></span> 个字符串的大小为 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3^i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.824664em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">3</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.824664em;"><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每个线段树维护对应字符串的 A 的数量， 最后查询第一个字符串中的 A 字符数量是否大于 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span></span></span></span>，如果大于就是输出 A，否则输出 B。</p><p>我们根据思路开始实现代码。</p><h3 id="22-建树"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#22-建树"></a> 2.2 建树</h3><p>建树部分的难点，主要在于编号为 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.65952em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">i</span></span></span></span> 的字符串，怎样从编号为 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.74285em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">i</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span> 的字符串转移而来，其实非常简单，对于编号为 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span></span></span></span> 的字符串，直接统计就可，否则，对于第 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.65952em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">i</span></span></span></span> 个字符串的第 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span></span></span></span> 个节点，可以从第 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.74285em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">i</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span> 个字符串的第 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\times 3-2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.66666em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span><span class="mbin">×</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.72777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;"></span><span class="mord">3</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span></span></span></span> 到第 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.66666em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span><span class="mbin">×</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">3</span></span></span></span> 个节点的 A 的数量决定，只要在这个区间内，A 的数量大于等于 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span></span></span></span>，这个节点的状态就为 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span>，否则为 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span></span></span></span>，然后进行最基础的区间合并。</p><p>建树及区间合并的代码如下：</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">//u0 表示这个区间里 A 字符的数量。</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//p 表示这个线段树所维护的字符串的编号。</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//为了方便，我们将字符串的 A 字符处理成了 数字 0，将 B 字符处理成了 1。</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title">pushup</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> p,<span class="type">int</span> x)</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    tree[p][x].u0=tree[p][<span class="built_in">lc</span>(x)].u0+tree[p][<span class="built_in">rc</span>(x)].u0;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">//将这个区间的左儿子和右儿子的 A 字符的数量相加。</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title">build</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> p,<span class="type">int</span> x,<span class="type">int</span> l,<span class="type">int</span> r)</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    tree[p][x].l=l;</span><br><span class="line">    tree[p][x].r=r;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(l==r) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span>(p==n) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">if</span>(a[l]==<span class="number">0</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                tree[p][x].u0=<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                tree[p][x].u0=<span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="comment">//query(p,x,l,r) 函数查询的是：编号为 p 的字符串中区间 [l,r] 中的 A 字符数量。</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="comment">//后面会提到这个函数。</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">if</span>(<span class="built_in">query</span>(p<span class="number">+1</span>,<span class="number">1</span>,l*<span class="number">3</span><span class="number">-2</span>,l*<span class="number">3</span>)&gt;=<span class="number">2</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                tree[p][x].u0=<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                tree[p][x].u0=<span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> mid=(l+r)&gt;&gt;<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">build</span>(p,<span class="built_in">lc</span>(x),l,mid);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">build</span>(p,<span class="built_in">rc</span>(x),mid<span class="number">+1</span>,r);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">pushup</span>(p,x);</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="23-单点修改"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#23-单点修改"></a> 2.3 单点修改</h3><p>单点修改操作与建树相同，编号为 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span></span></span></span> 的字符串直接修改，编号为 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.65952em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">i</span></span></span></span> 的字符串的第 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span></span></span></span> 个字符，也是第 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.74285em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">i</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span> 个字符串的第 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\times 3-2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.66666em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span><span class="mbin">×</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.72777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;"></span><span class="mord">3</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span></span></span></span> 到第 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.66666em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span><span class="mbin">×</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">3</span></span></span></span> 个节点的 A 的数量决定，由于与建树的过程基本一致，这里不再赘述。</p><p>单点修改的代码：</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title">change</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> p,<span class="type">int</span> x,<span class="type">int</span> id)</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(tree[p][x].l==tree[p][x].r) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span>(p==n) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            tree[p][x].u0^=<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">if</span>(<span class="built_in">query</span>(p<span class="number">+1</span>,<span class="number">1</span>,tree[p][x].l*<span class="number">3</span><span class="number">-2</span>,tree[p][x].l*<span class="number">3</span>)&gt;=<span class="number">2</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                tree[p][x].u0=<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                tree[p][x].u0=<span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> mid=(tree[p][x].l+tree[p][x].r)&gt;&gt;<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(id&lt;=mid) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">change</span>(p,<span class="built_in">lc</span>(x),id);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">change</span>(p,<span class="built_in">rc</span>(x),id);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">pushup</span>(p,x);</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="24-查询"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#24-查询"></a> 2.4 查询</h3><p>与普通的线段树查询一致，唯一的区别就是增加了编号，代码如下：</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">query</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> p,<span class="type">int</span> x,<span class="type">int</span> l,<span class="type">int</span> r)</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(l&lt;=tree[p][x].l&amp;&amp;tree[p][x].r&lt;=r) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> tree[p][x].u0;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> mid=(tree[p][x].l+tree[p][x].r)&gt;&gt;<span class="number">1</span>,da=<span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(l&lt;=mid) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        da+=<span class="built_in">query</span>(p,<span class="built_in">lc</span>(x),l,r);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(mid&lt;r) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        da+=<span class="built_in">query</span>(p,<span class="built_in">rc</span>(x),l,r);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> da;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="25-主函数"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#25-主函数"></a> 2.5 主函数</h3><p>由于我们的建树与单点修改中已经可以通过输入编号自动处理了，所以直接用 <code>for</code> 循环，从后往前处理每一个字符串即可。</p><p>主函数代码：</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">//FOR(a,b,c) for(int a=(b),a##end=(c);a&lt;=a##end;a++)</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//ROF(a,b,c) for(int a=(b),a##end=(c);a&gt;=a##end;a--)</span></span><br><span class="line">cin&gt;&gt;n&gt;&gt;q;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">FOR</span>(i,<span class="number">1</span>,<span class="built_in">qpow</span>(<span class="number">3</span>,n)) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">char</span> c;</span><br><span class="line">    cin&gt;&gt;c;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(c==<span class="string">&#x27;A&#x27;</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        a[i]=<span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        a[i]=<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">ROF</span>(i,n,<span class="number">1</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">//从后往前处理每一个编号的字符串，编号每减 1，总长度就除以 3。</span></span><br><span class="line">    seg.<span class="built_in">build</span>(i,<span class="number">1</span>,<span class="number">1</span>,<span class="built_in">qpow</span>(<span class="number">3</span>,i));</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">while</span>(q--) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> id;</span><br><span class="line">    cin&gt;&gt;id;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">ROF</span>(i,n,<span class="number">1</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment">//从后往前进行单点修改，注意每次修改的 id 都要进行变动，具体为 id=(id+2)/3。</span></span><br><span class="line">        seg.<span class="built_in">change</span>(i,<span class="number">1</span>,id);</span><br><span class="line">        id=(id<span class="number">+2</span>)/<span class="number">3</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(seg.<span class="built_in">query</span>(<span class="number">1</span>,<span class="number">1</span>,<span class="number">1</span>,<span class="number">3</span>)&gt;=<span class="number">2</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;A\n&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;B\n&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="时间复杂度"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#时间复杂度"></a> 时间复杂度</h2><p>单次建树：<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>N</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(3^N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.0913309999999998em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">3</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8413309999999999em;"><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>。<br />单词修改：<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>。<br />建树：<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>N</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(N3^N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.0913309999999998em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">3</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8413309999999999em;"><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>。<br />查询：<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(QN^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.064108em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">Q</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8141079999999999em;"><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>。<br />时间复杂度：<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>N</mi><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>N</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(N3^N+QN^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.0913309999999998em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;">O</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">3</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8413309999999999em;"><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.064108em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">Q</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">N</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8141079999999999em;"><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>]]></content>
      
      
